cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this analysis or its data, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "PostgreSQL patch analysis"
abstract: >-
  Is Postgres fixing more bugs, faster, and is LLM-assisted bug discovery
  behind it? A dbt + DuckDB pipeline over the PostgreSQL git repository, the
  pgsql-bugs and pgsql-hackers mailing lists and the published CVE severities,
  rendered as dbt charts dashboards.
authors:
